  <h2>3. Pricing</h2>
  <p>All prices are in Indian Rupees (INR) and inclusive of applicable taxes. Prices may vary based on market rates and availability. The price displayed at the time of order is the final price.</p>

  <h2>4. Payment</h2>
  <p>Payments are processed securely via Razorpay. We accept UPI, credit/debit cards, and net banking. Your payment details are not stored on our servers.</p>

  <h2>5. Delivery</h2>
  <p>We deliver to select areas. Delivery times are estimates and may vary. We are not responsible for delays caused by circumstances beyond our control.</p>

  <h2>6. Product Quality</h2>
  <p>We take great care to deliver fresh, high-quality produce. If you receive damaged or unsatisfactory items, please contact us within 24 hours with photos for a replacement or refund.</p>

  <h2>7. Cancellations</h2>
  <p>Orders may be cancelled before they are dispatched. Once dispatched, cancellations are not accepted. Please contact us immediately if you need to cancel.</p>

  <h2>8. Governing Law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts in India.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
